     "date": "2026-08-15",
     "note": "REAL — incomplete flush, false success on unknown commands, and over-write on info commands are three independent SCSI defects. (packet-only resend after the mixed-brief stall; P3 resolved)",
     "ev": "pipeline/evidence/b120/assess/minimax_resend_2026-08-15.md",
