     "note": "REAL - confirmed from source, incl. that hz is never read uninitialised (no UB, logic bug only). Delivery is DEAD on pmax (EXC3K) and unused on arc; live only on algor/evbmips/vocore. Latent for the owner's MIPS rigs.",
     "ev": "pipeline/evidence/_dispatches/fable5_n1n4_2026-08-15.md",
