wdcbeoddtail open med wdcbeoddtail  on a BIG-ENDIAN machine a 16-bit data-port read that pops the last valid byte plus the empty-ring sentinel folds the sentinel INTO the valid byte -- (v << 8) + 0xffff...ff = (v << 8) - 1, so the guest reads v-1 (0x00 becomes 0xff; a borrow can alter two valid bytes on a 4-byte read); the LE arm only pollutes the padding byte
wdcpktstatus open med wdcpktstatus  a REJECTED or CHECK-CONDITION ATAPI packet command completes with the ERR bit CLEAR (status 0x50): `atapi_st->status' is never consulted, `d->error' stays 0, and the #416 CHECK CONDITION repair never reached the IDE/ATAPI path -- an out-of-range READ(10) is delivered as zeros with success
