codex
Two checks changed the result. The RTL8139 attachment is behind `INCLUDE_LANDISK_NIC`, whose definition is commented out, so its three exits do not belong in the enabled-machine backlog. Also, i80321 modifies backing registers before its default branch; a blanket “drop the write” return would be incorrect. I’m leaving that conversion out of the first filing batch.
