The final batch has seven ready-to-file entries, led by Maple readback, XScale readback, and the MK48T08 RAM boundary. The source census leaves 76 unowned runtime error exits in 24 files. The report separates those from disabled attachments, dead branches, and internal guards whose failure has not been established, with a disposition and an existing test carrier for each proposed entry.
